graph TD
    subgraph Official Sources
        OS[Official Sources] --> SR[Source Registry]
        SR --> SE[Source Endpoints]
    end
    subgraph Ingestion
        SE --> DC[Discovery]
        DC --> FO[Fetch Orchestrator]
        FO --> RH[Resilient HTTP]
        RH --> RA[Raw Artifact]
        RA --> MN[MinIO]
        MN --> FD[Format Detector]
    end
    subgraph Processing
        FD --> PR[Processors]
        PR --> NM[Normalization]
        NM --> VL[Validation]
        VL --> OB[Observation]
    end
    subgraph Data Quality
        OB --> ER[Entity Resolution]
        ER --> RC[Reconciliation]
        RC --> CD[Canonical Data]
        CD --> PV[Provenance]
    end
    subgraph Presentation
        PV --> DB[PostgreSQL / PostGIS]
        DB --> VS[Document Search / PGVECTOR]
        VS --> API[Public API]
        API --> DE[Data Explorer]
        API --> AI[Civic AI]
    end
